.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Fix gdb.py \(dqstep\(dq command on a jump. Example where step will never stop:
.INDENT 2.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
(gdb) where
ASM 0xb7e3b917: JMP 0xb7e3b8c4 (eb ab)
ASM 0xb7e3b919: LEA ESI, [ESI+0x0] (8db426 00000000)
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
